{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-03-09 16:05:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND, MARCH 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF JOHNSON CONTROLS INTERNATIONAL PLC (NYSE: JCI) APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.35\xa0PER COMMON SHARE, AN INCREASE OF $0.01 FROM LAST QUARTER, PAYABLE ON APRIL 14, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 21, 2022. JOHNSON CONTROLS HAS PAID A CONSECUTIVE DIVIDEND SINCE 1887.'}